      "id": "claim_6c97508ea2eb47899c90c05d76a7ac19",
      "statement": "The production actor loop is a start-select-step cycle over the mailbox, a FuturesUnordered of in-flight effect futures, and a DelayQueue of armed timers; the select is deliberately unbiased because production permits every ready-input order.",
